# 19. Policy Resolution

Policies are evaluated in the following order

```
Workflow Policy

↓

Business Object Policy

↓

Organization Policy

↓

Tenant Policy

↓

Platform Default Policy
```

The first matching policy with the highest priority is applied unless explicit composition rules are configured.

---

# 20. Policy Composition

Multiple policies may be combined.

Example

```
